  ephemeris routines of Steve Moshier.


Why this package is separate
----------------------------

See docs/ADR/0004 in the Astrolysis repository. In short: the AGPL does not
permit closed-source software to link this library and serve it over a network.
Rather than relicense the whole of Astrolysis, the ephemeris calculations are
isolated in this package and the sidecar service that wraps it, both AGPL and
both published. The remainder of Astrolysis communicates with that service over
a network interface and is a separate work.

Nothing proprietary belongs in this package. If you are adding knowledge-base
content, prompts, or generation logic here, you are in the wrong package.
